sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Istio as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Sidecar as Istio Sidecar<br/>(pod-local)
    participant REST as OVMS Drogon REST<br/>rest_port/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as OVMS gRPC Server<br/>grpc_port/TCP
    participant OV as OpenVINO Runtime<br/>(in-process)
    participant MPE as MediaPipe Graph Executor<br/>(in-process)
    participant S3 as S3 / GCS / Azure<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 1: REST Inference (KServe v2)
    Client->>Istio: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Platform Auth
    Istio->>Sidecar: Forward (mTLS)
    Sidecar->>REST: HTTP (pod-local, no TLS)
    REST->>OV: In-process inference call
    OV-->>REST: Inference result
    REST-->>Sidecar: HTTP response
    Sidecar-->>Istio: mTLS response
    Istio-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: gRPC Inference
    Client->>Istio: gRPC call<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Platform Auth
    Istio->>Sidecar: Forward (mTLS)
    Sidecar->>GRPC: gRPC (InsecureServerCredentials)
    GRPC->>OV: In-process inference call
    OV-->>GRPC: Inference result
    GRPC-->>Sidecar: gRPC response
    Sidecar-->>Istio: mTLS response
    Istio-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: OpenAI Chat Completions (Streaming)
    Client->>Istio: POST /v3/v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer API key (optional)
    Istio->>Sidecar: Forward (mTLS)
    Sidecar->>REST: HTTP (pod-local)
    REST->>MPE: MediaPipe graph execution<br/>(continuous batching)
    MPE->>OV: Token generation
    OV-->>MPE: Generated tokens
    MPE-->>REST: SSE stream
    REST-->>Sidecar: Chunked HTTP response
    Sidecar-->>Istio: mTLS stream
    Istio-->>Client: SSE stream response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 4: Model Loading from HuggingFace
    REST->>HF: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS (system CA)<br/>Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>REST: Model artifacts via libgit2/curl

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 5: Model Loading from Cloud Storage
    REST->>S3: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS (BoringSSL)<br/>Cloud provider credentials
    S3-->>REST: Model files
